    "updated_at": "2021-06-28T00:42:02Z",
    "body": "Starship is not the same kind of software as e.g. MySQL, you usually don't worry about compatibility with other stuff and there aren't many reasons to stay at an outdated version. That's why I think dedicated docs for each version is not very crucial. ",
